# OTC release kinds and versions (issue #183).
#
#   <release>	<minor|major|critical>	<major.minor>
#
# minor: everything else. major: changes that affect security, stability or
# durability - the device tells its owner in Notifications. critical: breaks
# compatibility with the bridge or the apps if not installed, or a serious
# security fix - every app shows a banner until it is installed.
# Signed like VERSIONS (RELEASES.sig, scripts/release.sh); kept apart from
# it because the update runners read VERSIONS by position. Releases before
# 84 have no version and show as builds.
